# Reserved group-name prefixes.
# Format:
# <PREFIX> = <HTTP_USER_ALLOWED_TO_CREATE> [<GROUP_URI_GRANTED_ADMIN>]
#
# An empty value reserves the prefix so nobody can create matching groups.
# Obtain the active rules from the current AC service owner before migration.

# <FILL_PREFIX> = <FILL_HTTP_USER> [<FILL_GROUP_URI>]
# <FILL_DENIED_PREFIX> =
